==== help ====
~~~~ live area ~~~~
  ␛[1;94mKeys␛[m
  Enter        send, or queue while a turn runs
  Shift-Enter  new line (also Alt-Enter, Ctrl-J)
  Ctrl-C       cancel the turn; again to exit
  Ctrl-D       exit (empty input)
  Tab          complete a /command; on empty input, focus waiting approvals and
               queued messages
  Up/Down      recall earlier messages
  F1           show this help

  ␛[1;94mCommands␛[m
  /approve     open the waiting approvals and questions
  /drop        delete the last queued message
  /exit        exit; the session stays in Dex
  /help        list keys and commands
  /image PATH  attach an image to the next message
  /model ID    change the model
  /steer       steer the last queued message into the turn

␛[2m Esc close␛[m

